pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.80<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2012<br/>Winter Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Find a hero who appreciates your fight against the demons of Tibia.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains of Havoc</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Banshee\">Banshees</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lich\">Liches</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Torturer\">Dark Torturer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\">Grim Reaper</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Betrayed%20Wraith\">Betrayed Wraiths</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blightwalker\">Blightwalker</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hand%20of%20Cursed%20Fate\">Hand of Cursed Fate</a> and minor creatures.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Demon outfit and addons, <a href=\"#/wiki/Achievements\">achievement</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/True%20Dedication\">True Dedication</a> <br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Demon Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Demon_Male_Addon_3_af15f0.gif\" width=\"65\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Demon Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Demon_Female_Addon_3_6169bf.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Outfits%20Quest%2FSpoiler\">Spoiler</a> • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Outfit\">Outfit</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Demon Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Demon_Male_e7c206.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Demon Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Demon_Female_f7a214.gif\" width=\"65\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h4>\n<p>After completing the <a href=\"#/quest/the-annihilator-quest\">Annihilator Quest</a>, talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h4>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b> <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: Greetings, fellow <i><b>traveller</b></i> &lt;Player&gt;! <br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>outfits </b> <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: I'm tired of all these young unskilled wannabe heroes. Every Tibian can show his skills or actions by wearing a special outfit. To prove oneself worthy of the demon outfit, this is how it goes: ... <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: The base outfit will be granted for completing the annihilator quest, which isn't much of a challenge nowadays, in my opinion. Anyway ... <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: The shield however will only be granted to those adventurers who have finished the demon helmet quest. ... <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: Well, the helmet is for those who really are tenacious and have hunted down all 6666 demons and finished the demon oak as well. ... <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: Are you interested? <br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes </b> <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: So you want to have the demon outfit, hah! Let's have a look first if you really deserve it. Tell me: <i><b>base</b></i>, <i><b>shield</b></i> or <i><b>helmet</b></i>? <br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>base </b> <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: Receive the base outfit, &lt;Player&gt;. <br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye </b> <br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>: See you later, &lt;Player&gt;.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Demon Outfits Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Shield_Addon\">Shield Addon</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Demon Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Demon_Male_Addon_1_6f1797.gif\" width=\"65\"/></span><br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Demon Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Demon_Female_Addon_1_0aff48.gif\" width=\"65\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method_2\">Method</span></h4>\n<p>After completing the <a href=\"#/quest/demon-helmet-quest\">Demon Helmet Quest</a>, talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts_2\">Transcripts</span></h4>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div 